<title>PHILIPPINES: MacroAsia eyes PAL ground services.</title>
<headline>MacroAsia eyes PAL ground services.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>MacroAsia Corp said on Friday it was negotiating with Philippine Airlines to take over its ground services.</p>
<p>&quot;We're looking at ground services of PAL, including catering and cargo handling,&quot; MacroAsia vice president Daniel Pido told Reuters after the stockholders' meeting.</p>
<p>He said MacroAsia might create subsidiaries to assume the different services.</p>
<p>MacroAsia is 70 percent owned by PAL.</p>
<p>At present, it offers catering services at the Manila international airport and helicopter services.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
